<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:40:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>丹·勒布的第三点对冲基金恢复私人投资</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dan-loeb-s-third-point-hedge-fund-resumes-private-investments</link><description>Third Point创始人丹·勒布(Dan Loeb)表示，在长期中断之后，他将在其主要对冲基金中恢复对私营公司的投资。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dan-loeb-s-third-point-hedge-fund-resumes-private-investments'&gt;丹·勒布的第三点对冲基金恢复私人投资&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Dan Loeb’s Third Point Hedge Fund Resumes Private Investments&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dan-loeb-s-third-point-hedge-fund-resumes-private-investments</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:07:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Saks 如何重塑奢侈品集团典范</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-saks-is-reclaiming-luxury-as-exemplar-luxury-group-video</link><description>彭博社的 Romaine Bostick 报道了 Exemplar Luxury Group（前身为 Saks Global）自今年早些时候摆脱破产保护以来如何重塑自身，以在奢侈品领域重新开始。 Exemplar Luxury Group 首席执行官 Geoffroy van Raemdonck、FIT 副教授 Shawn Grain Carter、Telsey Advisory Group 首席执行官 Dana Telsey 以及 Exemplar Luxury Group 总裁兼首席文化官 Darcy Penick 分享了他们的想法。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-saks-is-reclaiming-luxury-as-exemplar-luxury-group-video'&gt;Saks 如何重塑奢侈品集团典范&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：How Saks Is Reclaiming Luxury as Exemplar Luxury Group&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-saks-is-reclaiming-luxury-as-exemplar-luxury-group-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:18:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stocks Set for Gains After Late US Rebound: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>埃及大开罗地区道路交通事故造成至少30人死亡</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/egypt-road-accident-kills-at-least-30-in-greater-cairo</link><description>一辆运载石油产品的卡车在大开罗地区起火，造成埃及多年来最严重的交通事故，造成至少 30 人死亡。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/egypt-road-accident-kills-at-least-30-in-greater-cairo'&gt;埃及大开罗地区道路交通事故造成至少30人死亡&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Egypt Road Accident Kills at Least 31 in Greater Cairo&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/egypt-road-accident-kills-at-least-30-in-greater-cairo</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:08:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</link><description>由于中东持续的敌对行动可能破坏该地区原油出口的复苏，石油价格连续两天上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26'&gt;11 月 26 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 26&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-26</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:03:15 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>